' ============================================================================
' 53 The diagnostic codes of TensorLogic, grouped by the phase that raises
'    them.
'
' Source of Figure TL8 in ../tensor-logic/static-semantics.md (section 12).
' The map restates the table of that section. It adds no new fact.
'
' Reading order:
'   1. The root names the codes. The right side holds the phases before
'      the normal form exists: decode, lexical and Unicode, resolution.
'   2. The left side holds elaboration, checking and evaluation.
'   3. Every code fails closed. NotNfc is a warning: the term is normalized.
'
' Colors come from concept-colors.iuml (aliases of the shared palette).
' Render: ./render.sh 53-tl-error-codes.puml   Check: ./render.sh --check

@startmindmap 53-tl-error-codes
!include ../../../casper/theory/diagrams/palette.iuml
!include concept-colors.iuml
<style>
mindmapDiagram {
  node {
    LineColor $rrs_relation
    FontColor $ca_neutral
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor $rrs_relation
  }
}
</style>
title The diagnostic codes of TensorLogic, by phase
*[$rrs_tl_term] TL diagnostic codes
**[$rrs_tl_engine] Decode
***[$rrs_reject]:NotATensorTerm
UnknownTensorLanguage;
**[$rrs_tl_engine] Lexical and Unicode
***[$rrs_reject]:NotNfc (a warning)
ConfusableIdentifier
MixedScriptIdentifier
NonAsciiOperator
LiteralKind
LiteralRange;
**[$rrs_tl_engine] Resolution
***[$rrs_reject]:UnknownTensor
UnknownFunction
AmbiguousName
ReservedName
BinderClash
OperatorMix
ArityMismatch;
left side
**[$rrs_tl_engine] Elaboration
***[$rrs_reject]:MixedStyle
BroadcastMismatch
MatmulMismatch
AxisOutOfRange
AxisRequired
EinsumSpec
EinsumEllipsis
SliceOutOfRange
RankUnknown;
**[$rrs_tl_engine] Checking
***[$rrs_reject]:ShapeMismatch, IndexUnbounded
LhsNegative, NegativeIndexConstant
NotBoolean, UnsafeVariable, NonGroundFact
AccumulationMismatch, InputRedefined, PrivateQuery
NotStratified, UnguardedRecursion, VirtualIndexMisuse
ScoreNotRecordLocal, ScoreRecursive, NoQuery
InlineTooLarge, TensorTooLarge, PrecisionOutOfRange
TemperatureNegative, NotConstant;
**[$rrs_tl_engine] Evaluation
***[$rrs_reject]:Undefined (an output element is ⊥)
PrecisionExhausted
NonFiniteValue, NotANumber, MalformedNumber
DimensionMismatch, ValueOutOfRange
HostWorkRejected;
legend bottom
**Concept colors**
|<$rrs_tl_engine> | a phase of the TL engine |
|<$rrs_reject>    | the codes of the phase: each fails closed |
endlegend
@endmindmap
